# Public URL of the deployed page, with a trailing slash (e.g. https://example.com/).
# Empty until a domain exists: the build then leaves canonical and og:url out,
# points og:image at /og.png, writes robots.txt without a Sitemap line and skips
# sitemap.xml, and the share link uses the address the page was opened at.
# Set it here or in the host's environment variables (those take priority).
VITE_SITE_URL=
